---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_supplied: tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_not_claimed: allocation not already claimed for msg.sender
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_verify_proof: verify merkleProof against claimMerkleRoot for (msg.sender, amount, vestingParams)
    q_verify_proof --> q_mark_claimed: allocationClaimed[msg.sender] = true
    q_mark_claimed --> q_check_vesting: vestingDuration > 0?
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: yes: deploy vesting contract for msg.sender
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_vesting: askToken.transfer(vestingContract, amount)
    q_transfer_vesting --> q_store_vesting: vestingContractAddress[msg.sender] = vestingContract
    q_store_vesting --> [*]: emit TokensClaimed event (vested)
    q_check_vesting --> q_transfer_direct: no: askToken.transfer(msg.sender, amount)
    q_transfer_direct --> [*]: emit TokensClaimed event (immediate)

    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supply: tokens not supplied
    q_revert_supply --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: invalid proof
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof

    note right of q_verify_proof
        INV-001: merkle proof validates against claimMerkleRoot set during publishSaleResults
        INV-002: each investor can claim exactly once
        INV-003: vesting contract deployed only for time-locked allocations
        INV-004: total claimed tokens cannot exceed totalTokensAllocated
    end note
